fonts/ holds three typefaces under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, each with its licence next to it:
Departure Mono, Newsreader (two cuts of it: Display Regular and Text Medium) and Atkinson
Hyperlegible Next.

The two cuts of Newsreader are fixed instances of its variable font, made with fontTools
(varLib.instancer) from the Latin file of @fontsource-variable/newsreader 5.3.0
(newsreader-latin-opsz-normal.woff2): optical size 72 at weight 400 for headlines, and optical
size 24 at weight 500 for names. Nothing else in them is changed.

The word VERIFIED on the stamp (page.mjs) is drawn from outlines of Anton, Copyright 2020 The Anton
Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/AntonFont.git), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
The text of that licence is the one in fonts/Newsreader-LICENSE.txt.

